description:
base-receipt-verify: Base Receipt Verify API: checks on Base mainnet that a transaction really paid USDC to an address - status, transfer, amount, payer and EIP-3009 nonce from the chain logs, never from the relayer. $0.005 USDC per check (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"tx": "string, required - tx hash", "pay_to": "string, required", "amount_micro": "string, optional", "from": "string, optional", "nonce": "string, optional"}
